      "limitations": [
        "States have no entity or enum: the status is the string reports.current_status (submitted, assigned, in_progress, resolved), repeated in status_updates.new_status and notifications.notified_status; the ReportStatus classes are transient and not drawn.",
        "Foreign-key columns are not Java fields of their own: they are shown on the association labels (e.g. citizen_id, operator_id, report_id).",
        "The discriminator column 'role' of users is not a field; it is shown in the User and subtype responsibilities.",
        "The backing database (MySQL reports_db, hbm2ddl.auto=update) comes from persistence.xml and is not drawn by the data-model viewpoint; see evidence model element ds:reports_db.",
        "Citizen and MunicipalOperator add no columns of their own; they share the users table and differ only by the discriminator value.",
        "Only associations present as mapped fields are drawn: Notification is not reachable from Report (no collection on Report)."
      ],
